                    '- When to use: Use for healthcare facility due diligence, star-rating and quality '
                    'comparisons, nursing-home staffing/inspection/fines research, or building a '
                    'location-bounded list of Medicare-certified providers.\n'
                    '- When NOT to use: Do not use for clinical trial recruitment data, environmental '
                    'compliance, campaign finance, corporate registry lookups, or contractor licensing.\n'
                    "- Named alternatives: Use 'clinical_trials_search' for ClinicalTrials.gov study data, "
                    "'epa_facility_search' for environmental compliance, 'us_business_entity_search' or "
